<notes>NOTE:
This .fdp file was created for the PC/Steam version of Galaxy On Fire 2. It will most likely not work with any other version.
Some of the events in this file are empty or missing. Those events are all from the Valkyrie and Supernova DLCs. Although the events are originally included in the PC version of the game, the soundbanks for them are missing. This is because the DLCs were never released for the PC version of the game</notes>
